# Git

`main` is the only long-lived branch. Work happens on feature branches. CI runs on pull requests: unit tests, typecheck, lint, build, codegen drift, Playwright, and `docker compose build`. There is no deploy workflow.

Commit messages follow Conventional Commits. The pre-commit hook formats staged files with Biome and restages them. The commit-msg hook runs commitlint.
